---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Septic System Design New River AZ | Diaz Environmental LLC"
  description="Septic system design, soil evaluation and ADEQ permits in New River, AZ. Fast turnaround, bilingual service. Call (602) 812-8609."
  canonical="https://diazenviroaz.com/septic-new-river-arizona"
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="service-hero">
      <h1>Septic System Services in New River, AZ</h1>
      <p>ADEQ-certified septic design and percolation testing for New River and north Maricopa County. Fast 3-5 day turnaround, bilingual service.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Get a Free Quote</a>
    </section>
    <section class="service-body">
      <h2>Septic Systems in New River and North Phoenix Area</h2>
      <p>New River is a rural community in northern Maricopa County where virtually all properties rely on private septic systems. The mountainous terrain and rocky soil conditions in this area require specialized knowledge — which our team has after years of working throughout north Maricopa County.</p>

      <h2>Services We Provide in New River, AZ</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Site and soil evaluations for new construction</li>
        <li>Percolation testing in rocky and caliche conditions</li>
        <li>Seepage pit performance testing</li>
        <li>ADEQ-approved septic system design</li>
        <li>Maricopa County permit submission</li>
        <li>Septic inspections for real estate transactions</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Rocky Soil Experts</h2>
      <p>New River's rocky desert terrain requires a different approach to percolation testing and system design. We are experienced with the specific soil profiles of north Maricopa County and can recommend the most appropriate ADEQ-approved system for your lot conditions — whether that's a conventional system, an alternative treatment unit, or a seepage pit design.</p>

      <h2>Diseño Séptico en New River, AZ</h2>
      <p>Diaz Environmental realiza evaluaciones de suelo, pruebas de percolación y diseño de sistemas sépticos aprobados por ADEQ en New River y el norte del Condado de Maricopa. ¡Hablamos español y respondemos el mismo día!</p>
    </section>
    <section class="service-cta">
      <h2>Serving New River, Anthem, Cave Creek & North Maricopa County</h2>
      <p>Call <a href="tel:6028128609">(602) 812-8609</a> for a free consultation.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Contact Us Today</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
  .service-page { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 2rem; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
  .service-hero { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .service-hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-hero p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-body h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #154a2a; margin: 2rem 0 1rem; }
  .service-body p { color: #444; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-body ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .service-body ul li { padding: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 1.5rem; position: relative; color: #444; }
  .service-body ul li::before { content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .service-cta { text-align: center; background: #f0f7f2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 3rem 2rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
  .service-cta h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-cta p { color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-cta a[href^="tel"] { color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; background: #154a2a; color: white; padding: 13px 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; transition: background 0.3s; }
  .btn:hover { background: #0d3019; }
</style>